  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1G1kSx7l\">本章节主要描述获取Token背后的账户关系</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t1e39d7f-dF8XVk9C\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-3Ib50iSK\"><col data-id=\"c8d88bea-Qf6M8KDN\" span=\"1\" width=\"50%\"/><col data-id=\"c8d88bea-1VlIeMLJ\" span=\"1\" width=\"50%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-h5jgAYeC\"><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-llKA8T6X\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-KjkS8TGT\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-29ORQ6I0\">接口</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tfafd194-O9kB3XhN\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BTfU5fbK\">作用</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-j0SQIjhO\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-04FVIek6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-P6fjgeOG\">获取已授权的账户（店铺/代理商）</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t6079300-kILgdHjQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CBJ35ID4\">拿到Token后，若需要获取账户，需要调用的第一个接口，该接口可以获取到客户在授权页面选择授权的店铺/代理商</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-5A718lMJ\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-imfScHE9\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8FI5icUd\">获取店铺账户关联的投放账户列表</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t6079300-DbGc7LfH\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bKNBqD8r\">在获取到店铺账户id后，通过本接口可以获取店铺下面的所有投放账户，包括直投账户和代投账户</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-H56NbVYU\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t114fa75-KAf8jCQ7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ahNQbD9O\">获取代理商账户关联的投放账户列表</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tc5b1a8b-MBMASIF0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sISot0bT\">在获取到代理商账户id后，通过本接口可以获取代理商下面的所有投放账户</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
